 INSTALLATION
 ------------

 1) insert  disk 1  into drive  A
 2) type  a:install
 3) insert  disks 2 and 3 when asked for


 TO RUN THE  PROGRAM
 --------------------

 Type GIOCA and press RETURN


 MEMORY REQUIREMENT
 ------------------
 The program needs 512Kb of memory


 ERROR MESSAGE INSUFFICENT MEMORY
 --------------------------------

 This happens if there are   installed in memory  drivers or TSR programs
 using parts of  512 Kb needed by the game



 SAVE GAME POSITION
 ------------------

 1) press S
 2) select one of 10 positions with  up/down arrows
    (ANNULLA to exit  without save )
 3) to edit the choosed name press right arrow and insert the new
    name (backspace to cancel)
 4) press ENTER


 RESTORE GAME POSITION
 ---------------------

 1) press L
 2) select one of 10 positions with  up/down arrows
    (ANNULLA to exit  without load )
 4) press ENTER




 QUIT GAME
 ---------

 You can exit game pressing SPACE

